# Automation Services Portfolio

Portable automation scripts, local-model tooling, and network diagnostics.

## Repo contents
- `portfolio_automation_services.html` — portable portfolio page
- `router_port_verify.py` — TCP/HTTP port-forward verifier
- `tron_grpc_compat_preflight.py` — offline gRPC/TLV readiness tests
- `tron_seednode_handshake.py` — seed node handshake probing
- `tron_watchdog.js` — lightweight node monitor
- `tplink_portforward_guide.md` — keyboard-driven router port-forward flow
- `router_verify_checklist.md` — verification checklist
- `TASK_init_plan.md` — iteration planning template

## Worklog
See `WORKLOG.md` for project history and verified capabilities.

## Testing
Activate the project venv and run:
- `./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q`

## Policy
No secrets or real credentials are stored in this repo. Passwords, tokens, and keys are referenced as placeholders only.
